      "description": "A tall opaque fill-extrusion stands in the valley just behind the ridge at the map centre, seen from the south at pitch 60. The ridge is nearer the camera than the block, so it must hide the block's lower two thirds and leave only the top showing above the skyline; a block painted over the ridge in full means the extrusion is not depth-tested against the terrain mesh."
